# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CONFIDENTIAL pre-filing IP material (defense-in-depth). The operative control
# is "no remote push until repository visibility + disclosure authorization are
# established" (see research/execution-state.md blocker B-VIS / B-PUSH). This
# path additionally keeps the brand name, the detailed unified calculus, novelty
# assessment, prior-art matrix, invention disclosures and the provisional-patent
# technical package OUT of the tracked tree so an accidental future push cannot
# carry them. Source code implements the methodology under neutral internal names
# and is tracked+committed locally (never pushed) under the same B-PUSH control.
research/dtec/_confidential/
**/_confidential/
